      "kind": "prose",
      "heading": "What This Service Involves",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "This page gives you a complete picture of the components we replace during a full BMW engine rebuild. We don't just repair the immediate problem — we refresh every part that commonly wears out, ensuring the engine delivers its original performance and reliability."
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "Our rebuilds are carried out in-house using BMW-specific tooling, with all components sourced to OEM standards or better. Every job includes a full strip-down, inspection, machining where required, and reassembly with new gaskets, seals, bearings, and timing components."
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "Read our [full rebuild checklist](/guides) for more detail on our inspection process."
        }
      ]
    },
